{"steam_appid":897730,"steam_name":"Among Trees","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/897730/367718/b8b8089675f21cf8a3cda95f16bc45bc2e879cf1/1750594829/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1635969361","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256833664/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1635969361","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/ss_3cfadb8900c90dee1903cc39e636d374c164f9fd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1636537260","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/ss_e26b65a20ce2fce2aec041fa29aab01220f2486c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1636537260","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/ss_9964d5ebc34a916f7899b97ba2929bb22e461a1a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1636537260","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/ss_785672c67574ca06d219386e920f9cbc3cc0cf62.1920x1080.jpg?t=1636537260","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/ss_b6da9304a5dcb4b6236142ecadf3c865751e3b17.1920x1080.jpg?t=1636537260"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2>Explore a living, colorful world, ranging from dense forests to dark caves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/c71c8f358204ccb437dd10040cdd8654.poster.avif?t=1636537260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/c71c8f358204ccb437dd10040cdd8654.webm?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/c71c8f358204ccb437dd10040cdd8654.mp4?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD</h2>Your cabin grows with you: build new rooms to unlock additional game mechanics, including cooking, gardening, crafting and sewing.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/2d67a716434d81b0f5c6f55aef8ded17.poster.avif?t=1636537260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/2d67a716434d81b0f5c6f55aef8ded17.webm?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/2d67a716434d81b0f5c6f55aef8ded17.mp4?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW</h2>Nurture delicate (and delicious) plants in your greenhouse. Eat them raw or make a stew for better nutritional values.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/2efc72e78172e8032373dfb5aa65eea0.poster.avif?t=1636537260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/2efc72e78172e8032373dfb5aa65eea0.webm?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/2efc72e78172e8032373dfb5aa65eea0.mp4?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2>Dangerous animals roam some areas in the woods. Better keep a distance if you can. <br><i>(Among Trees also includes a ZEN mode without dangerous animals)</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/4f2610d1eeeebc5a1f96b29823f6c3ce.poster.avif?t=1636537260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/4f2610d1eeeebc5a1f96b29823f6c3ce.webm?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/4f2610d1eeeebc5a1f96b29823f6c3ce.mp4?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEST FRIENDS FOREVER</h2>While the wilderness can be dangerous, it doesn't mean you can’t make new friends. Adopt a Fox Pet who you can feed, pet, and train to help you find loot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/9dfe5b441ffcfcdd71d4ec970ee367e5.poster.avif?t=1636537260\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/9dfe5b441ffcfcdd71d4ec970ee367e5.webm?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897730/extras/9dfe5b441ffcfcdd71d4ec970ee367e5.mp4?t=1636537260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1, Windows 10 (64-bit versions only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 or AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 670 or AMD R9 270<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1, Windows 10 (64-bit versions only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4770 or AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 or AMD R9 290X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["FJRD Interactive"],"publishers":["FJRD Interactive"],"release_date":"10 Nov, 2021"}